OL,3,AZelensky prepares for Oslo talks with
OL,4,AUS envoys as Rubio denies withholding
OL,5,Aintelligence
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS special envoy Steve Witkoff has
OL,8,Farrived in Norway ahead of talks with
OL,9,FVolodymyr Zelensky with relations on
OL,10,Fthe slide between the Ukrainian leader
OL,11,Fand US President Donald Trump.
OL,13,FNorwegian Prime Minister Jonas Gahr
OL,14,FStC8re said Zelensky had asked Oslo and
OL,15,Fneighbouring Finland to organise the
OL,16,Fmeeting with the US and European allies
OL,17,F"at a critical time for Ukraine".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
