OL,3,AZelensky prepares for Oslo talks with
OL,4,AUS envoys as Rubio denies withholding
OL,5,Aintelligence
OL,6,
OL,7,FAhead of the meeting, US Secretary of
OL,8,FState Marco Rubio rejected as
OL,9,F"scandalous" and "outrageous"
OL,10,Faccusations that Ukrainians were dying
OL,11,Fbecause the US was withholding
OL,12,Fintelligence from Kyiv.
OL,14,FHe was speaking after Zelensky's
OL,15,Fmilitary technical adviser, Serhii
OL,16,F"Flash" Beskrestnov, told the BBC that
OL,17,Fthe lack of reliable US warnings meant
OL,18,Flives were being lost.
